  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A next-generation lip oil with a cooling, creamy, and hydrating formula with a sheer glaze of color—a refreshing scoop of gelato for your lips.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Apricot and Raspberry Seed Oils: Nourishing properties leave lips looking smooth and plump with hydration.</p><p>- Liquid Shea Butter: Lightweight with a highly conditioning feel for softer lips.</p><p>- Chilled Glaze: Provides a cooling sensation.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Lip Glaze is a next-generation lip oil that delivers refreshing, nourishing care</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe onto bare lips or use as a finishing glaze over your favorite lip products.<br>-Reapply as needed for a refreshing and hydrating moment on lips.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Apricot and Raspberry Seed Oils: Nourishing properties leave lips looking smooth and plump with hydration. <br>-Liquid Shea Butter: Lightweight with a highly conditioning feel for softer lips. <br>-Chilled Glaze: Provides a cooling sensation. <br><br>Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Hydrogenated Poly(C6-14 Olefin), Ethylene/Propylene/Styrene Copolymer, Octyldodecanol, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Squalane, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Oil, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Seed Oil, Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Kernel Oil, Rosa Canina Fruit Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Menthoxypropanediol, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Butylene/Ethylene/Styrene Copolymer, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Tin Oxide, Benzoic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A next-generation lip oil with a cooling, creamy, and hydrating formula with a sheer glaze of color—a refreshing scoop of gelato for your lips.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Apricot and Raspberry Seed Oils: Nourishing properties leave lips looking smooth and plump with hydration.</p><p>- Liquid Shea Butter: Lightweight with a highly conditioning feel for softer lips.</p><p>- Chilled Glaze: Provides a cooling sensation.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Lip Glaze is a next-generation lip oil that delivers refreshing, nourishing care</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe onto bare lips or use as a finishing glaze over your favorite lip products.<br>-Reapply as needed for a refreshing and hydrating moment on lips.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Apricot and Raspberry Seed Oils: Nourishing properties leave lips looking smooth and plump with hydration. <br>-Liquid Shea Butter: Lightweight with a highly conditioning feel for softer lips. <br>-Chilled Glaze: Provides a cooling sensation. <br><br>Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Hydrogenated Poly(C6-14 Olefin), Ethylene/Propylene/Styrene Copolymer, Octyldodecanol, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Squalane, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Oil, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Seed Oil, Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Kernel Oil, Rosa Canina Fruit Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Menthoxypropanediol, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Butylene/Ethylene/Styrene Copolymer, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Tin Oxide, Benzoic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).</div></details>",
